 t,b=p['/'];b=b.replace('I help businesses turn their ideas into clear, distinctive websites—and connect them with the design, content, and marketing they need next. You work directly with me, from the first conversation to handover.','I design, develop and redesign websites for small businesses, and provide white-label web development for agencies. You work directly with me, from the first brief through testing and handover.')
